  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In an April 7, 2026 statement, Joon Park said ARS had established a new Director of Digital Agriculture to position the agency for the AI and digital agriculture era and support responsible adoption of novel innovations. Park said that, as lead for USDA’s NPG-AgTech, ARS remains committed to rigorous evaluation of emerging technologies through a transparent, science-based process supporting their adoption. He said the position would help empower scientists, programs, and external partners to develop, adopt, evaluate, and deploy emerging technologies that enhance public–private innovation and accelerate the research-to-farmer pipeline.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3"
   ],
   "sentences": [
